2026-07-27T11:45:10.8270752Z Start test: reusing a cached on-disk driver does not record a storage choice
2026-07-27T11:45:10.8331400Z duckdb keeps downloaded extensions and secrets in a temporary directory:
2026-07-27T11:45:10.8332133Z i /tmp/RtmpZyTVOS/duckdb
2026-07-27T11:45:10.8332670Z This is removed when the R session ends.
2026-07-27T11:45:10.8333273Z * Extensions are re-downloaded each session.
2026-07-27T11:45:10.8334279Z * Secrets are lost.
2026-07-27T11:45:10.8335289Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = TRUE) (or create ~/.duckdb) to keep them (suitable for most users).
2026-07-27T11:45:10.8336475Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = FALSE) to accept the temporary directory (and silence this message).
2026-07-27T11:45:10.8337699Z i See ?duckdb_storage for details and alternatives.
2026-07-27T11:45:10.8602032Z   'test-storage-message-once.R:52:3' [success]
2026-07-27T11:45:10.8711072Z   'test-storage-message-once.R:53:3' [success]
2026-07-27T11:45:10.9170982Z   'test-storage-message-once.R:59:3' [success]
2026-07-27T11:45:10.9336549Z End test: reusing a cached on-disk driver does not record a storage choice
